    "en": {
      "trackName": "Toddler Pea Game",
      "description": "Find the hidden pea in this delightful, interactive game for toddlers!\nDesigned specifically for the Apple Watch, the Toddler Pea Game is a simple and engaging \"shell game\" twist created for little hands and growing minds.\nHow to Play: Two hands appear on the screen. The green pea hides under one of them. Your child simply taps the hand they think is hiding the pea. Finding it rewards them with a happy \"pea\" emoji and a gentle vibration (haptic feedback)!",
      "releaseNotes": "Visual update: We've added a proper left and right hand to make the game even better for toddlers! Small bug fixes and performance improvements.",
